<title>UK: TABLE-Blacks Leisure profits surge 383 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Blacks Leisure profits surge 383 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.57		  vs  5.54</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  2.75		  vs  1.75</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  4.00		  vs  2.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     10.2		   vs  2.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   85.6		   vs 59.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Chairman and chief executive Simon Bentley said: &quot;In the current year, trading has continued to be strong&quot;. Retail sales in the first 11 weeks were up 36 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>Full name of sports equipment and fashion retailer - Blacks Leisure Group Plc.</p>
</text>
